3. Invoked at runtime, NOT redistributed
================================================================================

The following tools are OPTIONAL and are resolved from an explicit path, a
local untracked tools/ subfolder, a standard install location, or PATH. None
of them are included in this repository, so their licenses do not attach to
TCPK's distribution. Install them yourself if you want the related features.

  Wireshark / tshark / dumpcap   GPL-2.0-or-later   pcap analysis (Pcap tab)
  Frida                          wxWindows 3.1      runtime hooking
  mitmproxy / mitmdump           MIT                traffic interception
  CFR (cfr.jar) + a JRE          MIT (CFR)          Java decompilation
  Sysinternals (ProcMon, etc.)   Microsoft EULA     process monitoring
  Ollama and hosted LLM APIs     varies by provider optional AI review

The four Mono.Cecil assemblies named in section 1 are the only third-party
BINARIES redistributed here. The repository also tracks its own images (icons,
logo, documentation screenshots), which are TCPK's own work and carry no
third-party licence.

